Error [E0335]: trailing blocks are gone — pass code with `() =>`
  --> tests/ui/trailing_block_on_index.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     xs[0] {
    |           ^
 Why: a bare `{ }` here is not a call argument; code arguments use `() => { … }` inside a call's parentheses (D-TRAILBLOCK2)
 Fix: write `callee(() => { … })` on a call — this expression is not a call
